"<option>--enable-all-tests</option>: This switch allows more tests to be run"
" with <command>make check</command>."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-all-tests</option>: Essa chave permite que mais testes "
"sejam executados com <command>make check</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/gnupg2.xml:226
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-g13</option>: This switch enables building the g13 program."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-g13</option>: Essa chave habilita a construção do "
"aplicativo g13."

